stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  state "Appended to commitlog" as Appended
  state "Acknowledged" as Ack
  state "In memtable" as Memtable
  state "On SSTable" as SSTable
  [*] --> Appended: mutation received
  Appended --> Ack: ACK before or after sync
  Ack --> Memtable: apply mutation
  Memtable --> SSTable: flush memtable
  SSTable --> [*]: commitlog segment releasable
